{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"e2f010886b6dab37b945bfe9a0cf192abf048ccba33a2290d1638dc364f0612c","slug":"introducing-the-technical-notes","location":"/articles/introducing-the-technical-notes/introducing-the-technical-notes.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Introducing Underworld Technical Notes","description":"The writing on this site that people want to cite now has its own series. A technical note is written like a short paper, gets an archival PDF, and carries a DOI that resolves to it.","banner":"/underworldcode.org-preview/5750721cf0/build/banner-94ee7ee2cdc55a661ead0594074b62f9.jpg","keywords":["Underworld Code"],"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Louis Moresi","given":"Louis","family":"Moresi"},"name":"Louis Moresi","orcid":"0000-0003-3685-174X","affiliations":["Australian National University"],"id":"contributors-introducing-the-technical-notes-generated-uid-0"}],"affiliations":[{"id":"Australian National University","name":"Australian National University"}],"date":"2026-08-14","license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"open_access":true,"github":"https://github.com/underworld-technical-notes/underworldcode.org","numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"source_url":"https://github.com/underworld-technical-notes/underworldcode.org/blob/main/articles/introducing-the-technical-notes/introducing-the-technical-notes.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/underworld-technical-notes/underworldcode.org/edit/main/articles/introducing-the-technical-notes/introducing-the-technical-notes.md","thumbnail":"/underworldcode.org-preview/5750721cf0/build/banner-94ee7ee2cdc55a661ead0594074b62f9.jpg","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"introducing-the-technical-notes.md","url":"/underworldcode.org-preview/5750721cf0/build/introducing-the-tech-ea64f558a3157e1c4d74258dfed966c9.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"uwtn-banner","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/underworldcode.org-preview/5750721cf0/build/banner-94ee7ee2cdc55a661ead0594074b62f9.jpg","key":"oFmGUNtxOw","urlSource":"figures/banner.jpg"},{"type":"div","class":"uwtn-credit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Photo by ","key":"WoDPmG0Z6d"},{"type":"link","url":"https://unsplash.com/@lukashron?utm_source=underworld-technical-notes&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=api-credit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lukas Hron","key":"G91x2sczaT"}],"urlSource":"https://unsplash.com/@lukashron?utm_source=underworld-technical-notes&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=api-credit","key":"EZ187wnjKU"},{"type":"text","value":" / ","key":"jkb4TeV2Im"},{"type":"link","url":"https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=underworld-technical-notes&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=api-credit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unsplash","key":"iWdX18JhzA"}],"urlSource":"https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=underworld-technical-notes&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=api-credit","key":"NAiIK8sqSL"}],"key":"KFRKlX19Yk"}],"key":"BJ1Q9W91nN"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Our underworld web site has always carried two kinds of writing. Some of it is news — a\nrelease, a workshop, a paper accepted. The rest is the sort of thing a reader\nlater wants to point at: how a solver behaves, what a benchmark\nmeasured and what it demonstrates, why a method works the way it does and\nwhere it stops working. The two have been mixed together, and there has been\nno way to cite the second kind.","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"nbyX8XmBw4"}],"key":"nMKtCac0HX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"So we now have ","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"uOf6WXsdmI"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"technical notes","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"xfU2HbkJ7F"}],"key":"rcUEueAYwE"},{"type":"text","value":" that are written like a short\npaper or perhaps a preprint. Each one carries a version, an archival PDF built from the same source as the\npage, and a DOI that resolves to that PDF. Deposit is deliberate rather than\nautomatic: a note is published here first, and only gets an identifier when we\ndecide it is worth one.","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"fW6HBE5eBP"}],"key":"jbYHLMZi3P"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The point is for us to write down what we have created with enough content\nto be useful and not a lot more, and then refer to it — from a paper, from an\nissue, from the next note; instead of describing it again. Not quite\ndocumentation and not yet a research publication.","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"KiB0kdaNJ0"}],"key":"hlotOgQL5N"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":42,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The first two are up: ","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"XnxBvVTtnl"},{"type":"link","url":"/moving-the-mesh-without-remaking-it/","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Moving the Mesh Without\nRemaking It","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"zyqnfnl5rx"}],"urlSource":"/moving-the-mesh-without-remaking-it/","key":"oVQRwqMl0A"},{"type":"text","value":", on redistributing mesh\nnodes to follow the physics without remeshing, and ","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"y9dk6y4uIX"},{"type":"link","url":"/running-underworld-in-a-browser/","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Running Underworld in a\nBrowser","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"rJ7XtYOpXl"}],"urlSource":"/running-underworld-in-a-browser/","key":"yTUnRbKv7C"},{"type":"text","value":", on launching any repository at any\nversion without installing anything.","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"Ibao1WNu1e"}],"key":"ibUH1OceR7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Everything written before is still here, at the same addresses. The fifty posts\nthat already carry DOIs keep them, and those DOIs still resolve.","position":{"start":{"line":44,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"key":"rPyl5JOWhP"}],"key":"hL0w2wSIfj"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you work with Underworld and have something worth writing down, the notes\nare open to you — ","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"ESRHlCGrHH"},{"type":"link","url":"/submit/","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"how to submit one","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"MTQyzBzGCm"}],"urlSource":"/submit/","key":"oHEQt2Lpvb"},{"type":"text","value":". You can read ","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"key":"L3rv3OF97u"},{"type":"link","url":"/notes","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"all of\nthem","position":{"start":{"line":47,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},